The generated assessment may currently contain fields such as:

correctOptionIndex
sampleIdealAnswer
explanation
rubric

DO NOT SEND THE ANSWER KEY TO THE CLIENT BEFORE SUBMISSION.

A learner must not be able to open DevTools and immediately see:

