or any equivalent answer field.

Create a server-side separation:

SERVER ASSESSMENT
-----------------
question
options
rubric if safe
concept
difficulty
internal answer key

CLIENT ASSESSMENT
-----------------
question
options
concept
difficulty
safe metadata

The correct answers must remain server-side until evaluation.

